WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.077 --> 00:00:19.061
Soon Zann was in the girls' room, showing them the message moth and telling them about the password.

2
00:00:19.802 --> 00:00:22.044
Darb was with him, yawning and confused.

3
00:00:22.064 --> 00:00:25.907
"I don't understand," Gliss said sleepily.

4
00:00:25.927 --> 00:00:28.008
"Who sent you this message?"

5
00:00:28.829 --> 00:00:30.090
"I bet it was Yog."

6
00:00:31.051 --> 00:00:32.052
Perda rubbed her eyes.

7
00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:34.002
"I think he wants to help us."

8
00:00:34.022 --> 00:00:38.225
"But if it was Yog, why wouldn't he have just let us out earlier?"

9
00:00:38.526 --> 00:00:39.146
Darb wondered.

10
00:00:39.166 --> 00:00:40.708
"Who cares?"

11
00:00:41.168 --> 00:00:41.649
Zann said.

12
00:00:41.669 --> 00:00:43.590
"Let's see if the password works!"

13
00:00:44.331 --> 00:00:45.712
"Are you crazy?"

14
00:00:46.093 --> 00:00:48.114
Gliss said, sounding more awake now.

15
00:00:48.135 --> 00:00:51.838
"If we use magic, Morb will be able to track us!"

16
00:00:51.858 --> 00:00:55.581
"Only if he's still paying attention," Perda argued.

17
00:00:55.601 --> 00:00:58.124
"Don't you remember what Yog told us?

18
00:00:58.964 --> 00:01:02.345
He said the trolls aren't zapping their Red prisoners away anymore.

19
00:01:03.045 --> 00:01:07.206
Maybe that means Morb used up all his power when he captured the king and queen."

20
00:01:07.226 --> 00:01:09.287
"Or maybe he didn't."

21
00:01:09.587 --> 00:01:10.587
Darb looked thoughtful.

22
00:01:10.607 --> 00:01:14.868
"We really have no idea why the trolls are keeping people at the zoo."

23
00:01:15.589 --> 00:01:18.470
Zann released the message moth and turned back to his friends.

24
00:01:18.490 --> 00:01:25.111
"I know one thing—we're not going to find Boz's Magic Master friends if we're stuck in the palace.

25
00:01:25.912 --> 00:01:27.092
And we need their help.

26
00:01:27.908 --> 00:01:31.069
I'm willing to take a risk and use magic to get out of here."

27
00:01:31.089 --> 00:01:33.671
"Me too," Perda said.

28
00:01:33.691 --> 00:01:34.871
"But we should hurry.

29
00:01:35.571 --> 00:01:37.692
Yog will be here soon to make our breakfast."

30
00:01:38.493 --> 00:01:39.193
Zann nodded.

31
00:01:39.213 --> 00:01:44.375
"Yeah, and if he's not the one who sent us the password, we don't want to be here

32
00:01:44.415 --> 00:01:45.255
when he arrives."

33
00:01:46.436 --> 00:01:47.276
Gliss hesitated.

34
00:01:47.296 --> 00:01:49.037
"I want to find my parents.

35
00:01:49.717 --> 00:01:53.859
But I think it might be better to just stay here and let the grown-ups figure out what

36
00:01:53.899 --> 00:01:54.239
to do."

37
00:01:54.619 --> 00:01:55.159
She shivered.

38
00:01:56.536 --> 00:01:58.737
"Plus I'm still worried that Morb might catch us."

39
00:01:58.757 --> 00:02:01.259
"Maybe she's right," Darb said.

40
00:02:01.279 --> 00:02:04.540
"He hasn't caught us so far," Zann pointed out.

41
00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:09.443
"Anyway, isn't it worth a little risk to find Boz's friends?

42
00:02:10.263 --> 00:02:16.827
Boz was always telling me stories about them, especially Teplo, who's supposed to be some kind of magical

43
00:02:16.947 --> 00:02:22.430
genius. A guy like that is much more likely to have a good plan than Slib."

44
00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:24.611
"Right," Perda agreed.

45
00:02:25.011 --> 00:02:26.412
"I say we go for it!"

46
00:02:27.144 --> 00:02:29.606
"Well Gliss still looked uncertain.

47
00:02:29.626 --> 00:02:34.730
"If you think we can get out of the palace without getting caught, I guess I'll go."

48
00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:38.053
"We'll be fine," Zann assured her.

49
00:02:38.073 --> 00:02:40.915
"But to play it safe, let's split up.

50
00:02:41.696 --> 00:02:45.519
Morb probably can't track all of us if we zap to different places.

51
00:02:46.420 --> 00:02:47.641
Then we can meet up on foot."

52
00:02:47.661 --> 00:02:49.402
"Split up?"

53
00:02:49.843 --> 00:02:50.864
Gliss said anxiously.

54
00:02:50.884 --> 00:02:53.085
"I don't want to go alone!"

55
00:02:53.105 --> 00:02:56.068
"You can take Darb with you," Zann said.

56
00:02:56.412 --> 00:02:58.274
"It's better if I zap alone anyway.

57
00:02:58.914 --> 00:03:02.798
Because if Morb is going to come after anyone, it will probably be me."

58
00:03:02.818 --> 00:03:05.460
"Smart plan," Perda agreed.

59
00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:06.721
"What do you say, Gliss?"

60
00:03:07.442 --> 00:03:08.223
Gliss bit her lip.

61
00:03:08.503 --> 00:03:10.685
"Okay," she said in a small voice.

62
00:03:10.705 --> 00:03:11.746
"I'll do it."

63
00:03:11.766 --> 00:03:19.573
"Good. Perda, Gliss, here's where you should focus on landing Zann described two spots in his old neighborhood.

64
00:03:20.173 --> 00:03:22.976
They all got dressed and then gathered again in the main room.

65
00:03:23.756 --> 00:03:27.738
Darb held on to Gliss' elbow while she, Zann, and Perda formed a circle.

66
00:03:28.819 --> 00:03:33.101
Zann touched one palm to Perda's right hand and the other to Gliss' left.

67
00:03:33.942 --> 00:03:35.583
Soon sparks were flying.

68
00:03:35.603 --> 00:03:39.725
"Focus on the places I told you about," Zann reminded them.

69
00:03:39.745 --> 00:03:41.806
"Zipflower!" Zap!

70
00:03:43.367 --> 00:03:45.808
Splash! "Oh man!"

71
00:03:46.349 --> 00:03:47.829
Zann moaned, looking down.

72
00:03:48.510 --> 00:03:50.951
He'd planned on landing at the corner near his old house.

73
00:03:51.732 --> 00:03:55.086
Instead he landed a short distance away in a fountain.

74
00:03:56.107 --> 00:03:59.309
But he forgot about his wet feet when he heard a loud grunt.

75
00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:02.752
Two huge trolls were charging right toward him!

76
00:04:03.413 --> 00:04:05.855
Leaping out of the fountain, Zann took off running.

77
00:04:06.555 --> 00:04:10.178
The trolls thundered after him, grunting to each other in their own language.

78
00:04:10.979 --> 00:04:13.321
Zann dashed out of the park and down a side street.

79
00:04:14.081 --> 00:04:17.384
Behind him he could hear the trolls getting closer with every step.

80
00:04:18.432 --> 00:04:22.273
Even though trolls were big and heavy, they could run fast when they wanted to.

81
00:04:23.073 --> 00:04:25.274
But they didn't know this neighborhood the way Zann did.

82
00:04:25.954 --> 00:04:31.516
He dashed down an even smaller street and vaulted over a garden wall before the trolls rounded the

83
00:04:31.556 --> 00:04:37.498
corner. He could hear them grunting with anger and confusion as he tiptoed across the garden and out

84
00:04:37.538 --> 00:04:38.918
the gate on the far side.

85
00:04:39.898 --> 00:04:43.879
As soon as Zann was sure that he'd lost the trolls, he jogged to the meeting spot.

86
00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:48.213
It was a quiet alley where nobody was likely to bother their little group.

87
00:04:48.953 --> 00:04:52.495
When he turned the corner, he saw Perda standing there, looking anxious.

88
00:04:52.515 --> 00:04:54.936
"Zann! You made it!"

89
00:04:55.396 --> 00:04:57.877
she cried, her face relaxing into a smile.

90
00:04:57.897 --> 00:05:00.538
"I was just starting to worry."

91
00:05:01.379 --> 00:05:02.079
Zann nodded.

92
00:05:02.099 --> 00:05:04.840
"Did you have any trouble with trolls when you landed?"

93
00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:07.161
"No," Perda said.

94
00:05:07.181 --> 00:05:07.962
"Did you?"

95
00:05:07.982 --> 00:05:11.943
"Yeah. I thought maybe they'd tracked our magic after all."

96
00:05:12.344 --> 00:05:13.044
Zann shrugged.

97
00:05:13.836 --> 00:05:16.518
"But Yog said there are trolls all over the city.

98
00:05:17.358 --> 00:05:19.940
It was probably just bad luck that they spotted me."

99
00:05:20.740 --> 00:05:22.341
"Probably," Perda agreed.

100
00:05:22.361 --> 00:05:27.004
"Now that we're out of the palace, we should try to find new disguises for you and Gliss."

101
00:05:27.924 --> 00:05:28.444
"You're right.

102
00:05:28.985 --> 00:05:32.226
And we should figure out how to get Zing back," Zann said.

103
00:05:33.227 --> 00:05:34.608
Perda nodded and then pointed.

104
00:05:34.628 --> 00:05:36.369
"Look! Here comes Darb."

105
00:05:36.389 --> 00:05:40.611
"Good." Zann glanced at Darb, who had just rounded the corner.

106
00:05:40.631 --> 00:05:41.572
"We did it!"

107
00:05:42.368 --> 00:05:46.611
Their excitement quickly disappeared though when they realized that Darb was alone.

108
00:05:47.431 --> 00:05:48.672
Zann's heart skipped a beat.

109
00:05:49.332 --> 00:05:50.233
Where was Gliss?

110
00:05:50.933 --> 00:05:55.075
When Darb got closer, Zann could see that his friend was completely terrified.

111
00:05:55.756 --> 00:05:56.476
"They got her!"

112
00:05:56.856 --> 00:05:58.297
Darb cried out as he reached them.

113
00:05:58.317 --> 00:06:00.419
"The trolls got Gliss!"
